// Title: Google Cloud Firewall Modified or Deleted
// ID: fe513c69-734c-4d4a-8548-ac5f609be82b
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Austin Songer @austinsonger
// Date: 2021-08-13
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
// Description: Detects  when a firewall rule is modified or deleted in Google Cloud Platform (GCP).
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((gcp.audit.method_name EQ "v*.Compute.Firewalls.Delete" OR gcp.audit.method_name EQ "v*.Compute.Firewalls.Patch" OR gcp.audit.method_name EQ "v*.Compute.Firewalls.Update" OR gcp.audit.method_name EQ "v*.Compute.Firewalls.Insert"))
